The files in this directory (src/wasm/engine/) are a fork of zware, the Zig
WebAssembly Runtime Engine by Malcolm Still.

  Upstream: https://github.com/malcolmstill/zware
  Forked from: master (commit pinned in this NOTICE at fork time, 2026-09).
  Upstream licence: MIT.

zware is distributed under the MIT Licence. That licence and Malcolm Still's
copyright are retained for these files. kaidb's own additions on top (fuel
metering, determinism, the database host ABI, page-backed caching) are part of
the kaidb project and carry the kaidb licence.

See embed-wasm.md for the design and the changes made to this fork.

Trim: the WASI host-function surface (wasi/) was removed. kaidb UDFs run with
no WASI (no filesystem, clock, or randomness); see embed-wasm.md section 8.
